<title>AUSTRALIA: Athletics-Sonia O'Sullivan wins in Melbourne.</title>
<headline>Athletics-Sonia O'Sullivan wins in Melbourne.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's Sonia O'Sullivan scored an impressive win in the women's 5,000 metres at a Grand Prix meeting at the Olympic Park in Melbourne on Wednesday.</p>
<p>O'Sullivan, 27, won the race in a time of 15:17.56.</p>
<p>She told Irish national radio that she still intended to run in the World Indoor Championships at Paris in two weeks time.</p>
</text>
